      "type": "text",
      "text": "A parachutist is falling towards the ground at a constant speed $v$. The rate at which she is losing gravitational potential energy is $R$."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The acceleration of free fall is $g$."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "What is the mass of the parachutist?"
    }
